                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy **^^Hero^^** to be the **nemesis** for the rest of the battle. You can pick an enemy unit in reserve.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">• If the enemy nemesis is destroyed by the **^^Hero^^** with this trait, give 1 grudge mark to each friendly **^^Fyrd of Fyrepeak^^** unit on the battlefield after removing the destroyed unit.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is within 12&quot; of the enemy nemesis when it is destroyed without having destroyed it themselves, give 1 grudge mark to each visible friendly **^^Fyrd of Fyrepeak^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them after removing the destroyed unit.</characteristic>
